From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Corentin Wallez <cwallez@chromium.org>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 18:11:30 -0700
Subject: [dawn][vk] Allow querying and filtering on Vulkan device/driver
 UUIDs.

Two new chained structs are added in VulkanBackend.h (because it is not
possible to declare a uint8_t[VK_UUID_SIZE] in dawn.json), with
additions to ChainUtilsImpl and tests.

 - AdapterPropertierVulkanUUIDs returns the device/driver UUIDs when
   chained in an AdapterInfo.
 - RequestAdapterOptionsVulkanUUIDs filters the returned adapters to
   return only the ones with matching device/driver UUIDs.

Other small changes are:

 - ChainUtils.h STypeFor is fixed to support extensions in ChainUtilsImpl
   for out structs.
 - VulkanDeviceInfo member names are aligned to all end with
   "Properties".

Bug: 563358700
Change-Id: I19231b0a77f97e3d62ffcaa6eed32d609c099427
Reviewed-on: https://dawn-review.googlesource.com/c/dawn/+/347715
Reviewed-by: Loko Kung <lokokung@google.com>
Commit-Queue: Corentin Wallez <cwallez@chromium.org>

diff --git a/docs/dawn/features/adapter_options.md b/docs/dawn/features/adapter_options.md
index 403c4dbeeb868e477d131626d3005769c138d0b1..9d2916a6c6ba95836a024dc783ea6b2cdfd5a380 100644
--- a/docs/dawn/features/adapter_options.md
+++ b/docs/dawn/features/adapter_options.md
@@ -38,6 +38,10 @@ When discovering adapters on D3D11 and D3D12, Dawn only discovers adapters match
 
 When discovering adapter on D3D11, Dawn creates an adapter matching the provided `RequestAdapterOptionsD3D11Device::device`, and `wgpu::Device` created from the adapter will share the same D3D11 device from `RequestAdapterOptionsD3D11Device::device`. This extension struct does nothing on other backends.
 
+### `RequestAdapterOptionsVulkanUUIDs`
+
+When discovering adapters on Vulkan, Dawn only discovers adapters matching the provided `RequestAdapterOptionsVulkanUUIDs::driverUUID/deviceUUID`. This extension struct does nothing on other backends.
+
 ### `DawnTogglesDescriptor`
 
 When discovering adapters, Dawn will use chained `DawnTogglesDescriptor` as required adapter
